--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Content
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Hibana ships no content and hosts no content. It reads from sources supplied by
third-party extensions that the user chooses to install. Responsibility for the
legality of any content accessed through those extensions rests with the user and
with the extension and site operators, not with this project.
